content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Reporter",
      "description": "Person who gathers info and creates news content"
    },
    {
      "name": "Interview",
      "description": "Conversation used by the Reporter to collect details"
    },
    {
      "name": "Local",
      "description": "Local official or witness providing info"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reliability Verification",
      "description": "Process where the Reporter checks facts"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source",
      "description": "Original provider of information for verification"
    },
    {
      "name": "Article Submission",
      "description": "Content the Reporter sends in as News",
      "attributes": [
        "News"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "News",
      "description": "Information forming the basis of submitted articles"
    },
    {
      "name": "Editor",
      "description": "Person who reviews and approves article content"
    },
    {
      "name": "Style Review",
      "description": "Editor’s refinement of clarity and tone"
    },
    {
      "name": "Submission Approval",
      "description": "Decision by the Editor that an article is ready"
    },
    {
      "name": "Layout Designer",
      "description": "Person who arranges content for print"
    },
    {
      "name": "Newspaper Page Layout",
      "description": "Arrangement of articles and visuals"
    },
    {
      "name": "Printer",
      "description": "Person or system producing physical newspapers"
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Page Layout",
      "description": "Completed layout ready for printing"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ink Supply",
      "description": "Ink resources used by the Printer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Paper Supply",
      "description": "Paper resources needed for printing"
    },
    {
      "name": "Newspaper Copy",
      "description": "Printed newspaper unit"
    },
    {
      "name": "Distribution Manager",
      "description": "Person who oversees newspaper delivery"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Route",
      "description": "Plan for delivering newspapers",
      "attributes": [
        "Customer",
        "Delivery Performance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Recipient of newspapers",
      "attributes": [
        "Address"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Address",
      "description": "Location where a Customer receives delivery"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Performance",
      "description": "Measurement of how well delivery goes"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delay Report",
      "description": "Message sent when deliveries run late"
    },
    {
      "name": "Editorial Team",
      "description": "Group informed about delivery delays"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscription Coordinator",
      "description": "Person who manages subscriptions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subscription",
      "description": "Active newspaper subscription by a Customer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Question",
      "description": "Message from Customer to ask or clarify something"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

